Unfortunately, restore ability and invisibility are virtually useless.  Long 
before a character can learn (let alone reliably cast) them he will have a 
unicorn horn and permanent invisibility.  The inclusion of useless spells in 
the game is certainly debatable, but it seems especially pointless for a 
character to be good at casting a spell that nobody ever casts.

I suggest:
The monk's special spell be changed to Levitation, as RL monks are well known 
for their levitation abilities.  The monk maximum level in escape spells 
should be increased to Skilled so that he can land at will. 

The ranger's special spell be changed to Identify, as Aragorn seemed 
to always know the history and function of whatever treasure the hobbits 
found.  Plus rangers need all the help they can get in this game. 

